        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "THE SITUATION"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A workforce management SaaS for staffing agencies and event operators, with a good product and a pipeline that depended on the founder's network."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Operations managers do not search for software until a shift goes wrong. LinkedIn spend was going to the wrong titles, and when buyers asked ChatGPT for options the platform was never mentioned."
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT WE CHANGED"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LinkedIn campaigns by job title and company size, with a comparison guide as the offer",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Fourteen answer-first guides on scheduling, compliance and timesheets, written to be quoted",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Comparison pages against the three platforms buyers shortlist",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Structured data, clear definitions and an llms.txt so AI tools could read the site",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Demo booking straight from the content, no form gate",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT HAPPENED"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Demo requests rose 190% in nine months, cost per lead fell 35% and the platform now appears in AI search answers for its category."
        }
      ]
    },
